  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Currently group notifications have a very clear button to permanently (?) unsubscribe from announcements, but the button to dismiss a single announcement is hidden in the ... menu. It's likely that people will click the antibell button out of habit, resulting in inadvertently unsubscribing from notifications. There should be a clear dismiss button with the same UI as friend requests and invites here.",
